{"4883040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Out of Office!", "steam_appid": 4883040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4963410], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUT OF OFFICE!</strong><br><strong></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations employees, you've been selected for our new initiative: mandatory company retreat!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/d404e8a34d5e4337ec0367585fadbb7a.poster.avif?t=1786926556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/d404e8a34d5e4337ec0367585fadbb7a.webm?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/d404e8a34d5e4337ec0367585fadbb7a.mp4?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LET’S TAKE THIS OFFLINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As part of this team building experience, your team gets the opportunity to test our new HIGH QUALITY tech products within the natural elements!  Each day will bring a new product to test and new tasks to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/397cd0197281095448ba081af820b6c3.poster.avif?t=1786926556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/397cd0197281095448ba081af820b6c3.webm?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/397cd0197281095448ba081af820b6c3.mp4?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME TO TOUCH GRASS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team will explore a unique Atlantic Canadian national park, complete with a variety of flora and fauna. Be on the lookout for all kinds of creatures, friendly and adversarial. But keep your wits about you, who knows what's lurking in the depths of the wilderness 👀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/dfcb6c11d83d3b10e7e3c6a4f1b50de3.poster.avif?t=1786926556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/dfcb6c11d83d3b10e7e3c6a4f1b50de3.webm?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/dfcb6c11d83d3b10e7e3c6a4f1b50de3.mp4?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON'T GET FIRED!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival is dependent on your ability to work as a team, each lost team member means a permanent handicap to your total<i> synergy</i>. Manage survival elements like ticks, hunger, poison, and your ever filling bladder to protect your synergy, or else you run the risk of being <i>terminated! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/c51c69bd185ac99fb7d0f915362f64b0.poster.avif?t=1786926556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/c51c69bd185ac99fb7d0f915362f64b0.webm?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/c51c69bd185ac99fb7d0f915362f64b0.mp4?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM BUILDING!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to get past the boss's <i>Team Building Activities. </i>Each new day brings a new activity - AKA an opportunity for the boss to test out some experimental technology. Each activity requires cooperation, like guiding each other through an obstacle course, or locating an isolated character in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/4d7b30b37ae0871f33cb67207a266c17.poster.avif?t=1786926556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/4d7b30b37ae0871f33cb67207a266c17.webm?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/4d7b30b37ae0871f33cb67207a266c17.mp4?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOBODY GETS LEFT BEHIND!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team work makes the dream work! Your survival is dependent on your ability to work as a team, each lost team member means a permanent handicap to your team’s performance! But don’t worry a worthy referral can bring them back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 to 6 player coop </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wiggle Physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glizzies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Raccoon Reincarnation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crazy dance moves</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUT OF OFFICE!</strong><br><strong></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations employees, you've been selected for our new initiative: mandatory company retreat!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/d404e8a34d5e4337ec0367585fadbb7a.poster.avif?t=1786926556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/d404e8a34d5e4337ec0367585fadbb7a.webm?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/d404e8a34d5e4337ec0367585fadbb7a.mp4?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LET’S TAKE THIS OFFLINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As part of this team building experience, your team gets the opportunity to test our new HIGH QUALITY tech products within the natural elements!  Each day will bring a new product to test and new tasks to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/397cd0197281095448ba081af820b6c3.poster.avif?t=1786926556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/397cd0197281095448ba081af820b6c3.webm?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/397cd0197281095448ba081af820b6c3.mp4?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME TO TOUCH GRASS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team will explore a unique Atlantic Canadian national park, complete with a variety of flora and fauna. Be on the lookout for all kinds of creatures, friendly and adversarial. But keep your wits about you, who knows what's lurking in the depths of the wilderness 👀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/dfcb6c11d83d3b10e7e3c6a4f1b50de3.poster.avif?t=1786926556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/dfcb6c11d83d3b10e7e3c6a4f1b50de3.webm?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/dfcb6c11d83d3b10e7e3c6a4f1b50de3.mp4?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON'T GET FIRED!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival is dependent on your ability to work as a team, each lost team member means a permanent handicap to your total<i> synergy</i>. Manage survival elements like ticks, hunger, poison, and your ever filling bladder to protect your synergy, or else you run the risk of being <i>terminated! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/c51c69bd185ac99fb7d0f915362f64b0.poster.avif?t=1786926556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/c51c69bd185ac99fb7d0f915362f64b0.webm?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/c51c69bd185ac99fb7d0f915362f64b0.mp4?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM BUILDING!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to get past the boss's <i>Team Building Activities. </i>Each new day brings a new activity - AKA an opportunity for the boss to test out some experimental technology. Each activity requires cooperation, like guiding each other through an obstacle course, or locating an isolated character in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/4d7b30b37ae0871f33cb67207a266c17.poster.avif?t=1786926556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/4d7b30b37ae0871f33cb67207a266c17.webm?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/extras/4d7b30b37ae0871f33cb67207a266c17.mp4?t=1786926556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOBODY GETS LEFT BEHIND!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team work makes the dream work! Your survival is dependent on your ability to work as a team, each lost team member means a permanent handicap to your team’s performance! But don’t worry a worthy referral can bring them back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 to 6 player coop </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wiggle Physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glizzies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Raccoon Reincarnation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crazy dance moves</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A 2-6 player co-op camping game with proximity voice chat. Your behind-the-times tech employer has sent you on a &quot;mandatory-fun&quot; nature retreat in Atlantic Canada. Manage ticks, hunger, a full bladder, and whatever else lurks behind the treeline! Underperform and risk being terminated... ⛺", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/a02a49a6ef5ce6316b68c5b0c4b98d1d26c570ed/header.jpg?t=1786926556", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/2d19ef39204cf8d305807a8e1be0f01d4f62716a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786926556", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883040/2d19ef39204cf8d305807a8e1be0f01d4f62716a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786926556", "website": "https://besszong.ca/out-of-office", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Amd Ryzen 3600 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Amd Ryzen 5600 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 306